00:06:02.889 --> 00:06:09.409
So they both agree in terms of what the same
variant and just a 45-degree line on the angle.

00:06:09.409 --> 00:06:16.800
And as you see, our ancestry, for the populations
and the variants, pretty consistent with 1000

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:23.919
genome and we set these blue lines indicating
the outliers so we see it is pretty stringent

00:06:23.919 --> 00:06:27.589
and that difference of plus or -0.15.

00:06:27.589 --> 00:06:30.289
And even then we have very few variants.

00:06:30.289 --> 00:06:37.629
These are AIMs informed markers that were
