00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:31.629
these mainly contain the drug response markers
and also variants in dbGaP, the GWAS Catalog

00:07:31.629 --> 00:07:37.740
with associations, p-values, of less than
10 to the minus five to some particular trait

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.330
